Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, bash, curl, ca-certificates, tar, libegl1, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libwayland-egl1, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxkbcommon-x11-0
Recommends: git, pkexec | policykit-1
Description: Install, update, and uninstall the vinoPilot apps
 Install, update, and uninstall the vinoPilot apps from one place:
 vinoWhisper, vinoAuthFace, vinoOpenEffects, vinoPop, vinoSpeak, vinoSearch,
 vinoWatch, and ovfetch. Each app ships its own checksum-verified installer;
 vinoPilot detects how each app was installed on your system, checks for
 updates from the matching source, and runs the appropriate installer.
 .
 This package includes the vinopilot CLI and the vinopilot-gui desktop app.
 Managed apps still install into your home directory through their own
 installers.
